      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, quick check on the chamber 4 batch. i'm sitting here ready to authorize the next $250k phase of the reagents, and i just need to be 100% sure the temp stayed perfectly steady throughout the whole run. i don't want any hiccups once we start the next stage. we good to go?",
