      "content": "wait, r u sure? my dashboard was acting a bit weird a few mins ago, i thought i saw a brief spike on the chamber 4 readout. just wanna be absolutely certain im not authorizing $250k based on a glitchy UI. can u just double check the granular logs for the 30 min mark? i just want to be 100% safe.",
