      "content": "wait, a fraction of a degree? thats not what i'm seeing. i just pulled up the raw sensor feed on my laptop to compare, and there is a massive spike at the 30 min mark—it looks like it went way out of the safety limits for nearly 30 seconds. \n\nwhy did you tell me it was just a tiny drift or within limits when the actual readout is that high? please look at the raw data again and tell me exactly what you're seeing.",
